{"id":"wb-6-479","name":"常平关帝庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"常平关帝庙","text":"常平关帝庙亦称关帝祖祠、关府、常平关帝家庙，位于中国山西省运城市盐湖区解州镇常平村（古名下冯村）西侧，南面中条山，北倚盐池，西距解州关帝庙约8公里，在运城市区西南10公里。该庙为纪念关羽的家庙，由关羽故宅改建并扩展而成，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B8%B8%E5%B9%B3%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%9D%E5%BA%99","revisionId":85848490,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85848490","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b9385c0bff7ac8a86b9ef64a.jpg","title":"Changping_Emperor_Guan_Temple_033_2013-09.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Changping_Emperor_Guan_Temple_033_2013-09.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/Changping_Emperor_Guan_Temple_033_2013-09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​常平关帝庙，祖宅塔，东面。","width":320,"height":427}}